<title>BOSNIA: NATO soldier stabbed in Bosnia.</title>
<headline>NATO soldier stabbed in Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A NATO soldier was stabbed in the shoulder in Bosnia's Serb-controlled territory on Wednesday, the NATO-led peace force said in a statement.</p>
<p>The injured soldier survived and was treated by doctors at a nearby hospital, the alliance said. The stabbing marked the first direct attack on soldiers in the peacekeeping force since NATO launched a raid last week on two Serbs indicted for war crimes.</p>
</text>
